flowchart TB
  accTitle: Groundskeeper identity and role boundary
  accDescr: GitHub OAuth issues an eight-hour secure session after installation allowlist checks. Only session hashes are stored. Every request checks current membership and role. Viewers read reviews; reviewers and admins save reviews. Admin browser changes and operator bootstrap share the same locked membership engine, version checks, last-admin protection and audit history.
  Browser["Browser"] -->|"Login redirect"| GitHub["GitHub OAuth<br/>State + PKCE"]
  GitHub -->|"Code and verified identity"| Callback["OAuth callback<br/>Installation allowlist"]
  Callback -->|"Secure HttpOnly cookie<br/>8-hour expiry"| Browser
  Callback -->|"Store SHA-256 token hash"| Sessions[("TeamSession<br/>Current TeamMember role")]
  Browser -->|"Cookie on every request"| Guard["Server access boundary<br/>Expiry · installation · membership"]
  Sessions --> Guard
  Guard -->|"viewer / reviewer / admin"| Read["Read analyses and team reviews"]
  Guard -->|"reviewer / admin only"| Write["Save shared review<br/>Origin check + transaction recheck"]
  Guard -->|"admin only · write origin check"| Admin["Team directory and membership<br/>Expected team version"]
  Operator["Operator CLI<br/>First-admin bootstrap and changes"] --> Membership["Membership engine<br/>Workspace → member locks<br/>Browser admin + version check<br/>Protect final admin"]
  Admin --> Membership
  Membership -->|"Grant · change role · revoke<br/>Revoke cascades sessions"| Sessions
  Membership -->|"Atomic versioned history"| Audit[("TeamAccessEvent<br/>Member or operator actor<br/>Latest 20 in directory")]

  classDef boundary fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#162e55;
